  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/860",
  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p></div><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">IV.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">소화순환호흡배설 단원의 마지막 단원인 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우리 몸에서 하는 일</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에서는 앞에서 학습했던 소화</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">순환</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">호흡</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">배설이 유기적으로 이루어지고 있음을 보여줍니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이 단원을 어떻게 효과적으로 학습할 수 있을까 고민하다가 모둠 마인드맵을 실시해보기로 했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 그냥 교과서를 읽고 수업을 하니 이미 배운 내용을 다시 배우는 것 같아 다른 방식으로 진행해보았습니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. A3 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">용지를 모둠</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">인 기준</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">별로 나눠줍니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모둠 내에서 소화</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">순환</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">호흡</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">배설 중 어떤 파트를 맡을지 역할을 분담합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. A3 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">용지에 전체적인 디자인을 연필로 스케치 한 후 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">등분 합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. 4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">등분 된 용지를 각각 받아서 자기가 맡은 파트의 마인드맵을 그립니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">다 그려진 마인드맵을 모아서 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">붙입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">용어 간에 연결할 부분이 있는지 모둠 내에서 검토하여 연결선으로 연결해줍니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우리학교 아이들은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">번이 안됩니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">좋은 작품은 학교에 게시하고 간식을 선물한다고 홍보했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">장점 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: 4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개 분야의 마인드맵을 이어 붙이고 용어들을</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">연결하다보면 소화</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">순환</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">호흡</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">배설의 과정이 유기적으로 이루어진다는 것을 쉽게 이해할 수 있을 듯 합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">아래의 사진은 나름 우수한</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">작품을 찍어보았습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/991648475BB5B5B91A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20181004_125118_HDR.jpg\"  id=\"A_991648475BB5B5B91A1F78\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D622475BB5B5BB1F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20181004_093333_HDR.jpg\"  id=\"A_99D622475BB5B5BB1F8100\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/998204475BB5B5BF27\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20181004_093338_HDR.jpg\"  id=\"A_998204475BB5B5BF27CC9E\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B708475BB5B5C20F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20181004_093342_HDR.jpg\"  id=\"A_99B708475BB5B5C20FD367\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9919B9475BB5B5C40A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"576\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"576\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20181004_093349_HDR.jpg\"  id=\"A_9919B9475BB5B5C40A2C8F\"/></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
